ght="85" class="page-header__text-image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-93adf07f></div></div></div><!----></section><section id="connecting-customers" data-slice="FeatureBanner" class="feature-banner feature-banner--pt-0 feature-banner--pb-0" index="1" data-v-054940bd><div class="feature-banner__container" data-v-054940bd><div class="feature-banner__content" data-v-054940bd><!----><h2 class="feature-banner__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-054940bd>Connecting customers</h2><div class="feature-banner__text" data-v-054940bd><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We continue to demonstrate our strength and resilience as a business, while highlighting the breadth and diversity of the Evri Group. In 2025/26, a transformational year in which we welcomed two new businesses into the newly expanded Group, we delivered record parcel volumes, up 17% on 2024/25.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Read more about our successful year in our latest annual report.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Transformational Year <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->– Formation of the Evri Group, following our merger with DHL e-commerce UK and acquisition of Ireland’s Coll-8.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Strategy through investment <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->– Over £80m invested to strengthen our operations, service and people, while continuing to future-proof the business.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Delivering quality <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->– Investment in technology to enhance our customer experience, including Veri-snap, an AI-powered system that reviews millions of delivery photographs.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Sustainability <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->– Achievements such as EcoVadis Gold accreditation, which places Evri in the top 5% globally for sustainability, and winning Decarbonisation Initiative of the Year reinforce our ESG progress.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Social Impact <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->– Fantastic results delivered in the first full year of our partnership with Scope, the UK’s leading disability equality charity, surpassing our fundraising target with over £180,000 raised.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----></div><div class="feature-banner__image" data-v-054940bd><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJYpbqstJ9-TgD_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3243b52b8.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJYpbqstJ9-TgD_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3243b.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=47%2C0%2C5906%2C3939&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJYpbqstJ9-TgD_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3243b.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=47%2C0%2C5906%2C3939&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJYpbqstJ9-TgD_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3243b.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=47%2C0%2C5906%2C3939&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="ParcelShop store assistant is standing at the till, holding a parcel and smiling for the photo." width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-054940bd></div><!----></div></section><section id="our-latest-report" class="section-wrapper article-link-module article-link-module--neutral conditional-section-wrapper" data-slice-type="article_link_module" data-slice-variation="default-slice" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-ebc71926><di